-- l4 batch over an export whose only input has a default. A CSV row whose
-- one cell is "" (T3c: empty, so absent) is still a row and takes the
-- default; so does a JSON row {} that supplies nothing.

§ `Capacity`
    GIVEN `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE

@export Capacity check
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`capacity check` MEANS `has capacity`
